/	BAR AND SCALE VALUE DRAWING ROUTINE.

DRAWIT,	.-.					/DRAW BAR AND SCALE VALUES ROUTINE
	DST;	DRWTEMP				/SAVE PASSED VALUE
	CLA					/CLEAN UP
	TAD I	DRAWIT				/GET PASSED Y-COORDINATE
	DCA	DRWAR1				/STORE IN-LINE
	TAD I	DRAWIT				/GET IT AGAIN
	TAD	(122)				/ADD ON OFFSET FOR DIGITS
	DCA	DRWAR2				/STORE IN-LINE
	DLD;	DRWTEMP				/GET PASSED VALUE
